description:
- Nhận yêu cầu và sử dụng phần mềm Wilcom Embroidery Studio để thiết kể mũi thêu cho máy vi tính;

- Kiểm tra mẫu thêu với các phòng ban liên quan đi đến thống nhất;

- Các công việc liên quan khác theo yêu cầu của cấp trên...

Phúc lợi:

- Lương, thưởng tháng 13, quà các dịp Lễ, Tết lớn trong năm;

- Tham gia BHXH đầy đủ khi vào chính thức, Phép năm theo quy định;

- Nghỉ 2 ngày thứ 7/tháng (hưởng nguyên lương), nghỉ 4 ngày chủ nhật; cơm trưa tại công ty;

- Được phát sữa thứ 3 hằng tuần;

- Phụ cấp dành cho Cha/Mẹ đơn thân nuôi con dưới 18 tuổi.

JOB SUMMARY

Building talent pools in advance of all requirements of company operations & business strategy.
Has overall responsibility for recruiting and selecting personnel to ensure adequate staffing at all levels.
Responsible for meeting all staffing requirements as directed by the company's short- and long-term plans.

ESSENTIAL DUTIES & RESPONSIBILITIES

Develop candidate source by building talent communities with such techniques as direct sourcing, users groups, networking, university career ambassadors and social media.
Participate in creating resourcing central database for graduate recruitment and more senior vacancies.
Coordinate with external suppliers for effectively providing with posting services, ads, searching account, community account, prepare reports on supplier performance.
Establish solid relationship with hiring managers, operate as talent advisor/ consultant in all aspects of recruitment by focusing on hiring expectations, sourcing strategy, candidate assessment…
Contribute to formulate employee and employer branding strategy / actions plan.
Preparing job descriptions and person specifications; designing or revising application forms, including developing online processes
Developing and maintaining an effective personnel advertising program for the purpose of maintaining high visibility with potential labor markets.
Preparing other recruitment material depending on the type of organization - for example, brochures and further particulars;
Developing creative recruitment solutions if the organization is experiencing difficulties in attracting the appropriate level and quality of staff;
Screening application forms and shortlisting applicants; devising, running and evaluating selection processes including interviews, psychometric tests, personality questionnaires and various group activities;
Keeping up to date with current employment legislation and ensuring that line managers are effectively briefed on any relevant changes;
Training staff in interviewing techniques and on the role of the assessor at a selection centre;
Developing plans to relocate staff to new departments and jobs due to restructuring within an organization;
Assisting in the implementation of redundancy programmers, which may include the development of early retirement packages and voluntary redundancy schemes.
Performing other related jobs as assigned by the Managers.

requirements:
Tốt nghiệp Đại học trở lên chuyên ngành Quản trị nhân lực, quản trị kinh doanh, sư phạm hoặc các ngành liên quan.
Từ 04 năm kinh nghiệm trong lĩnh vực đào tạo, ưu tiên ứng viên từng làm việc tại doanh nghiệp quy mô từ 300 nhân sự trở lên.
